sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Controller as ChatbotController
    participant Facade as ChatbotFacade
    participant Chatbot as ChatbotService
    participant Pre as InputPreprocessingService
    participant Intent as IntentClassificationService
    participant Interpret as InputInterpretationChain
    participant Retrieval as RetrievalService
    participant Vector as VectorSearchService
    participant Graph as GraphSearchService
    participant Embed as Embedding Model
    participant Mongo as MongoDB Atlas
    participant Refine as ResultRefinementChain
    participant Answer as AnswerGenerationChain
    participant Prompt as PromptService
    participant Token as TokenService
    participant LLM as LLMService
    participant Provider as LLM Provider

    User->>Controller: POST /api/v1/chatbot
    Controller->>Facade: chat(request)
    Facade->>Chatbot: generateResponse(request)

    Chatbot->>Pre: preprocess(input)
    Pre->>Pre: validate & normalize
    Pre-->>Chatbot: preprocessedInput

    Chatbot->>Intent: classifyIntent(preprocessedInput)
    Intent->>Intent: 키워드 규칙 (LLM 호출 없음)<br/>영어는 단어 경계, 한국어는 부분 문자열
    Intent-->>Chatbot: intent (RAG_REQUIRED / GENERAL 등)

    alt RAG 필요
        Chatbot->>Interpret: interpret(query)
        Interpret->>Interpret: 입력 정제 및 검색 쿼리 추출
        Interpret-->>Chatbot: searchQuery

        Chatbot->>Retrieval: retrieve(searchQuery, userId, options)
        Retrieval->>Vector: search(searchQuery, userId, options)
        Vector->>Embed: embed(query)
        Embed-->>Vector: queryVector
        Vector->>Mongo: $vectorSearch + 최신성 쿼리 → RRF(k=60)
        Mongo-->>Vector: 후보 문서
        Vector-->>Retrieval: SearchOutcome

        opt 근거가 약하고 augment.enabled (기본 꺼짐)
            Retrieval->>Vector: search(필터·유사도 문턱을 완화한 조건)
            Vector->>Mongo: 재검색
            Mongo-->>Vector: 후보 문서
            Vector-->>Retrieval: 1차 결과 뒤에 덧붙임
        end

        opt graph.enabled (기본 꺼짐)
            Retrieval->>Graph: search(query)
            Graph->>Mongo: tech_graph_nodes · tech_graph_edges 1홉 조회
            Mongo-->>Graph: 시드 노드와 이웃
            Graph-->>Retrieval: 그래프 근거 (벡터 상위를 밀지 않음)
        end

        Retrieval-->>Chatbot: RetrievalOutcome (벡터 · 그래프 · 병합 결과)

        Chatbot->>Refine: refine(results)
        Refine->>Refine: 유사도 필터링, 중복 제거, 상위 N건
        Refine-->>Chatbot: refinedResults

        Chatbot->>Answer: generate(query, refinedResults)
        Answer->>Prompt: buildPrompt(query, refinedResults)
        Prompt->>Token: truncateResults / validateInputTokens
        Token-->>Prompt: 상한 안에 맞춘 프롬프트
        Prompt-->>Answer: prompt
        Answer->>LLM: generate(prompt)
    else 일반 대화
        Chatbot->>LLM: generate(메시지 목록)
    end

    LLM->>Provider: chat(...)
    Provider-->>LLM: ChatResponse (답변 + tokenUsage)
    LLM->>LLM: 미터 기록 — 지연 · 실패 · 입력/출력 토큰 실측
    LLM-->>Chatbot: answer

    Chatbot-->>Facade: ChatResponse
    Facade-->>Controller: ChatResponse
    Controller-->>User: ApiResponse (ChatResponse)
